      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T22:34:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmm, thinking about it more there\u0027s a bunch of func calls in here which aren\u0027t checked.\nperhaps the opposite should be done ... a __nocfi helper called above, and open code this call, and make this function check cfi for bpf_jit_binary_hdr() and arch_bpf_jit_check_func() calls",
