      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T22:34:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Personally, I think I would tend to have two (or even three since you need helper func) #ifdef blocks in the bodies of 2 functions instead of this large #ifdef around the both of them...  I just find it easier to read when there\u0027s only 1 func definition and how it changes is clear.",
      "range": {
